s feel large and pain around eyes\ninto head."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"throat","label":"Throat","startLine":2082,"endLine":2087,"text":"Smarting in mouth. Tickling in throat,\nwith inclination to dry\\ spasmodic cough, especially at\nflight. Burning in fauces. White, sticky, mucus.\nChronic speakers’ catarrh. Catarrh of posterior nares\nand fauces with thick, stringy mucus."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"respiratory","label":"Respiratory","startLine":2088,"endLine":2093,"text":"Sudden, short cough, strangling.\nTickling in trachea and bronchial tubes. Wakes at 3\nA. M. with cough. Feels suffocated ; continuous cough,\nwhen lying down at night; sharp pain in lungs. Whoop-\ning Cough. — Dry, spasmodic cough."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"relationship","label":"Relationship","startLine":2094,"endLine":2095,"text":"Plyos.: Con.; Arg. nit.: Kali hick."}],"corpusPassages":[]}